CREATED:20260403T160405Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T163836Z
UID:10002484-1778968800-1778968800@buddiesinbadtimes.com
SUMMARY:Mama Don't Cry!
DESCRIPTION:May 16\, 2026  // 10pm // $40 – $65\nall prices + fees\nBUY TICKETS \n \nWelcome to a new night life alternative\, for those who miss dancing like nobody’s watching\, but secretly 🤫 wish they did. \nIs it a party? Is it a show? Is she gonna jump from there? 🫨 Gurl\, who knows\, but the energy will sure feel like SOMETHING’S ABOUT TO GO DOWN! \nSo buckle up henny! ‘Cuz This ain’t just your typical gay rodeo\, this is a high energy\, immersive social experience where techno\, house & pop music meets visuals and performance. A new concept created not just for those who want to go out\, but for those who want to feel ALIVE! \nWe promise to bring you Back to those euphoric eras\, to make you sweat\, scream\, and forget everything that does not align with being yourself ❤️ \nFollow us on Instagram for more info @mamadontcryto
URL:https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/event/mama-dont-cry/
LOCATION:Tallulahs
END:VEVENT
